00:00:00,013 --> 00:00:07,148
Bug 002. After Reset App State, the cart page still lists the item.

2
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:13,393
Step 1. Add the Sauce Labs Backpack and open the cart.

3
00:00:13,523 --> 00:00:16,313
The cart lists one item.

4
00:00:16,327 --> 00:00:21,472
Step 2. Open the menu and click Reset App State.

5
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:30,650
Expected: the cart is empty. Actual: the badge is gone, but the Backpack is still listed.

6
00:00:30,877 --> 00:00:37,742
After a reload, the item disappears. Workaround: reload the page.
